    [4911]={name="Thick Bark Buckler",quality=1,ilvl=5,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Attack on Camp Narache'.",zone="Red Cloud Mesa",questName="Attack on Camp Narache",lore="After carefully evaluating the map, you realize that what you discovered are the plans made by the Bristleback warchief for an extended siege on Camp Narache."},
    [4914]={name="Battleworn Leather Gloves",quality=1,ilvl=5,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Cutting Teeth'. Pick it over the other reward choices.",zone="Valley of Trials",questName="Cutting Teeth",lore="The first order of business will be to put a little strength in your backbone. I could send you out to the Barrens to hunt kodo, but well, in all honesty, you're more useful to us alive than dead."},
    [4921]={name="Dust-covered Leggings",quality=1,ilvl=5,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Burning Blade Medallion'. Pick it over the other reward choices.",zone="Valley of Trials",questName="Burning Blade Medallion",lore="Through my divinations, I see that an item of power hides deep within the Burning Blade Coven, guarded by beasts and black magic. It is called the Burning Blade Medallion, and your next task is to find it and remove it from the coven."},
    [4928]={name="Sandrunner Wristguards",quality=1,ilvl=8,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'From The Wreckage....'. Pick it over the other reward choices.",zone="Durotar",questName="From The Wreckage....",lore="One of my most observant scouts brings back word that the wreckage of Proudmoore's fleet still remains off the coast of Durotar, just east of Tiragarde Keep."},
    [4951]={name="Squealer's Belt",quality=1,ilvl=7,reqLevel=1,sourceType="world_drop",instructions="Drops from \"Squealer\" Thornmantle.",zone="Kalimdor",npc="\"Squealer\" Thornmantle"},
    [4954]={name="Nomadic Belt",quality=1,ilvl=5,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Hunt Begins'. Pick it over the other reward choices.",zone="Red Cloud Mesa",questName="The Hunt Begins",lore="You have a promising air about you, and will prove yourself to the tribe. Perhaps someday soon you will be welcomed into the great city of Thunder Bluff."},
    [4962]={name="Double-layered Gloves",quality=1,ilvl=8,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Gathering Leather'. Pick it over the other reward choices.",zone="Thunder Bluff",questName="Gathering Leather",lore="Greetings, young one. You have a gleam in your eye; I can tell you are eager to venture back to the plains for the hunt. May you bring honor to your clan!"},
    [4964]={name="Goblin Smasher",quality=2,ilvl=12,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Supervisor Fizsprocket'. Pick it over the other reward choices.",zone="Mulgore",questName="Supervisor Fizsprocket",lore="According to the documents you salvaged from the caravan, the Venture Co. created many plans to attempt to drive us from our lands here, so that they could have free reign to plunder our lands."},
    [5345]={name="Stonewood Hammer",quality=2,ilvl=14,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Centaur Bracers'. Pick it over the other reward choices.",zone="The Barrens",questName="Centaur Bracers",lore="The Kolkar are a threat to the Horde's claims in the Barrens; we must reduce the numbers of their troops. And so, I have a bounty task for you."},
